  "instance_name": "hypocrisy_in_politics",
  "label": "Hypocrisy in Politics",
  "description": "The concept of hypocrisy refers to the practice of pretending to have virtues, moral principles, or beliefs that one does not actually have. The meme uses the contradiction in the text — demanding a sanctuary city and then criticizing it for being 'used' to shelter undocumented individuals — to satirize or criticize political hypocrisy. This requires background knowledge of political discourse and the use of irony or satire in political memes.",
